{"availability":"available","full":"yas-sim/interactive-image-inpainting","name":"interactive-image-inpainting","description":"Deep Learning Based Interactive Image Inpainting Demo","category":"Design","language":"Python","stars":34,"forks":5,"created":"2020-05-06T05:01:47Z","updated":"2021-06-11T09:00:51Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"master","homepage":null,"topics":["deep-learning","demo","dl-models","draw","image-inpainting","image-ret","image-retrieval","inference","inference-engine","inpaint","intel","interactive-demo","openvino","openvino-toolkit","picture","python","undesired-objects"],"demo":"https://software.intel.com/en-us/openvino-toolkit","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T13:33:14.513Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T13:33:14.513Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T13:33:14.513Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T11:08:57.545Z","stars":34,"forks":5},{"at":"2026-10-10T21:01:48.388Z","stars":34,"forks":5},{"at":"2026-10-15T23:50:00.491Z","stars":34,"forks":5},{"at":"2026-10-18T13:33:14.513Z","stars":34,"forks":5}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This program demonstrates how the inpainting-gmcnn model works with the Intel(r) Distribution of OpenVINO(tm) toolkit. The demo program takes an image file and displays it on the screen. The user can draw the mask image on top of the input image, then the program will treat the masked areas as they are lacking and inpaint (compensate) the image by deep learning based inferencing. You can remove undesired objects from your picture by masking them and the program will generate a natural looking picture without the undesired objects.","これはIntel(r) Distribution of OpenVINO(tm) toolkitでinpainting-gmcnn (画像修復モデル)を使用する方法をデモするプログラムです。 デモプログラムは画像を１枚読み込み、表示します。ユーザーが入力画像の上に自由にマスクを描画したのち、プログラムがマスク部分を欠損部分として扱い、欠損部分を補うようにディープラーニングでの推論を行い修復描画(Inpaint)してくれます。 絵の中の望ましくない部分(景色に写りこんだ柵や人など)をマスクすることで、それらを取り除いた自然な絵を生成してくれます（当然ですが限度があります:-) ）。"],"features":[],"sourceUr